 ('ths-designer','Fifth Wave designer’s notes','Reproduced designer article at Zanotowane','https://zanotowane.pl/1199/3922/','The designer explains nanosocialism/infosocialism through patent and information conflicts, distinguishing it from simple industrial nationalization.','A reproduced design note, not a complete regional welfare charter; the official Fifth Wave page returned 403 and was respected.'),
